        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When you enter the Tower of Eden, planning isn’t enough - you have to adapt.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/ac34761a8c5174494bfd0f899f5f3810.avif?t=1764265979\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras_big/ac34761a8c5174494bfd0f899f5f3810.avif?t=1764265979 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized abilities each turn demand fast adaptation as you master four specialized <strong>combat classes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sword &amp; Shield</strong> - Balanced offense and defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gunsmith</strong> - Multi-target attacks to control the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mage</strong> - Elemental spells and debuffs that turn the tide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boxing</strong> - High-speed combos and multi-hit chains.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/0ce7aa2c310d2cc15ad1a0ddf7dc7074.poster.avif?t=1764265979\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/0ce7aa2c310d2cc15ad1a0ddf7dc7074.webm?t=1764265979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/0ce7aa2c310d2cc15ad1a0ddf7dc7074.mp4?t=1764265979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Izaak’s search for his missing wife leads him toward the Tower - toward the Astrian King. Every path forward ends at his gates. No matter how many times the ascent ends in failure, you must drive him to rise and climb again. Between climbs, gain the edge by recruiting allies, unlocking upgrades, and adjusting your approach for new challenges that lie ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/ffd7acfb76ff8d8628efe403fcecec35.avif?t=1764265979\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras_big/ffd7acfb76ff8d8628efe403fcecec35.avif?t=1764265979 width=800 height=442 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a new mix of tactics, enemies, and surprises, ensuring every playthrough is different but just as fun as the first one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/2342a2dc8060bdcfb00f776b6303ce8c.poster.avif?t=1764265979\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/2342a2dc8060bdcfb00f776b6303ce8c.webm?t=1764265979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/2342a2dc8060bdcfb00f776b6303ce8c.mp4?t=1764265979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic turn-based combat</strong>: Randomized abilities each turn force you to think fast and adapt your strategy that changes with every combat class.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/9e6c943fec9f4f287e8fbebb7d9cd61d.poster.avif?t=1764265979\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/9e6c943fec9f4f287e8fbebb7d9cd61d.webm?t=1764265979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/9e6c943fec9f4f287e8fbebb7d9cd61d.mp4?t=1764265979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A more casual take on the rougelike genre</strong>: Not as punishing for the player, while keeping the same values as the classics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression between runs</strong>: Upgrade your arsenal, recruit allies, and prepare for tougher challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/c9649beb0147f916ec972d2be3671de2.avif?t=1764265979\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras_big/c9649beb0147f916ec972d2be3671de2.avif?t=1764265979 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless replayability</strong>: Every climb offers new enemies, secrets, and strategic opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning art and extensive lore</strong>: Immerse yourself in the Tower’s rich world while testing your will-power to climb.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the Tower, challenge its guardians, and reveal the truth buried in Astra’s shadows...though some answers were never meant to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369700/extras/4bcb3aa422a10c0396789f53f8c66f26.avif?t=1764265979\" width=1560 height=2206 /></span></p>",
